===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|вели́кий}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-{{PAGENAME}}.ogg|Audio}}

===Adjective===
{{ru-adj|вели́кий|peri|comp2=бо́льший|велича́йший|absn=величина́}}

# [[large]], [[big]]
#: {{syn|ru|большо́й|q1=more common in modern Russian}}
# {{lb|ru|short form only}} [[too]] [[big]]; [[large]]r than [[necessary]]
#: {{ux|ru|[[этот|Э́ти]] [[сапог|сапоги́]] [[я|мне]] '''велики́'''.|These boots are too big for me.}}
# [[great]], [[outstanding]]

====Declension====
''in the meanings "big, too big":''
{{ru-decl-adj|вели́кий|b}}
''in the meaning "great, outstanding":''
{{ru-decl-adj|вели́кий|a'}}

====Usage notes====
* A special short form is found in the expression {{m|ru|[[от]] '''ма́ла''' [[до]] [[великий|вели́ка]]||[[all ages]]|lit=from [[small]] to [[big]]}}. Here '''ма́ла''' and '''вели́ка''' are old short genitives.

